==Battleground==
*1 [[Vega (Enemy)|Vega]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Vega is only at 10% magnification and the peons only 150%. Use [[Classification#Ranger|Rangers]] so that they won't get knocked back. Alternatively, you can use [[Classification#Rusher|Rushers]] to attack Vega in between attacks, although this is this is is harder than just using Rangers to chip Vega down.

